{"timestamp": "2026-04-23T12:24:29.871278Z", "level": "INFO", "component": "StegoPipeline", "trace_id": null, "message": "```json\n[\n  \"This is giving me major Operación Condor vibes and it's honestly terrifying. It feels like we're seeing people just disappear into thin air.\",\n  \"The unmarked cars and the gunpoint abduction make this feel way more like a militia operation than actual law enforcement. It's scary how easy it is to just snatch someone off the street.\",\n  \"We're literally watching people get disappeared by private actors, which is exactly what happened in those South American dictatorships. This is such a massive red flag.\"\n]\n```", "log_domain": "stego", "log_area": "llm", "log_op": "encode", "llm_stage": "raw"}
