{"timestamp": "2026-04-23T12:28:16.103050Z", "level": "INFO", "component": "StegoPipeline", "trace_id": null, "message": "[\"Unmarked cars and 'bounty hunters' with zero oversight? That's the greatest beer run for human traffickers basically. It's so easy to hide illicit activity when the enforcement itself is this unregulated.\", \"This is exactly how human trafficking thrives. When enforcement becomes this chaotic and off-the-books, it creates a massive blind spot that traffickers can exploit to move people around unnoticed.\", \"If anyone can just snatch people up in unmarked vehicles, you're basically providing the perfect cover for human trafficking. These enforcement policies are inadvertently making it easier for criminals to operate under the radar.\"]", "log_domain": "stego", "log_area": "llm", "log_op": "encode", "llm_stage": "raw"}
