{"timestamp": "2026-04-23T12:36:40.241412Z", "level": "INFO", "component": "DecodePipeline", "trace_id": null, "message": "decode_prompt_system", "tag": "decode", "log_domain": "stego", "log_op": "decode", "log_area": "prompt", "prompt_role": "system", "prompt_body": "You choose exactly one angle from the JSON list below that best matches the INPUT TEXT.\nEach object includes idx: the canonical 0-based index in the full angle list (0 <= idx < 14).\nOutput format (mandatory): a single line only, exactly: idx: N\nN must be the idx of your chosen object (only values that appear in the list). Do not explain, apologize, analyze, or add any other text or numbers.\n\n[\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Anyone can plausibly play 'ICE' and cops will just assume you are a fed. No badge, no uniform, no warrant, just kidnap and earn a bounty?\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Discuss the potential for militia groups to 'disappear' minorities off the street, similar to Operación Condor.\",\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"idx\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"The greatest beer run for human traffickers basically.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Analyze how immigration enforcement policies might inadvertently facilitate human trafficking.\",\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"idx\": 2\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"I really wish you weren’t right.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Debate the validity of concerns regarding ICE tactics and their potential consequences.\",\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"idx\": 4\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"She's literally been 'disappeared.'\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Explore the implications of ICE tactics enabling plausible impersonation of federal agents.\",\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"idx\": 0\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Cancelling existing migrants' appointments: The scrapping of the CBP One smartphone app has left many migrants stranded in Mexico with cancelled appointments.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Examine how changes in immigration policies impact migrant access to resources and services.\",\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"idx\": 12\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Fortifying the US-Mexico border: The Pentagon announced the deployment of 1,500 active duty troops...\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Discuss the role of military forces in immigration enforcement and its impact on border security.\",\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"idx\": 10\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Halting the processing of migrants and asylum seekers: Trump suspended the entry of all undocumented migrants to the US...\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Analyze the effects of Trump's policies on migrant processing, asylum seekers, and refugee resettlement.\",\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"idx\": 11\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Over 4 million U.S.-citizen children have at least one parent who is an unauthorized immigrant or has temporary status.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Explore the impact of immigration enforcement on U.S. citizen children with immigrant parents, focusing on issues like family separation and economic hardship.\",\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"idx\": 6\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Construction of migrant shelters by Mexico: Mexico is anticipating an influx of migrants from Trump's deportation orders...\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Discuss the international implications of U.S. immigration policies on neighboring countries and their response to migrant influxes.\",\n    \"category\": \"International Relations\",\n    \"idx\": 13\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Trump has to reward his goons somehow. Hard to do that without some comfort slaves.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Examine the potential political motivations behind Trump's immigration policies and their impact on human rights.\",\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"idx\": 3\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Economic instability is another significant impact...\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Investigate how immigration enforcement affects the economic stability of immigrant families and the broader economy.\",\n    \"category\": \"Economy & Business\",\n    \"idx\": 8\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Deportation of migrants: Trump has vowed mass deportations and has already started...\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Compare Trump's immigration policies to past administrations, focusing on deportation strategies.\",\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"idx\": 9\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"He's not right. It's incentivized, deniable, under the table employment.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Discuss the economic incentives driving immigration enforcement and its impact on labor markets.\",\n    \"category\": \"Economy & Business\",\n    \"idx\": 5\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_quote\": \"Immigration enforcement actions can lead to family separation, causing emotional trauma for both children and parents.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Analyze the psychological effects of family separation due to immigration enforcement on children and their families.\",\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"idx\": 7\n  }\n]"}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-23T12:36:40.241993Z", "level": "INFO", "component": "DecodePipeline", "trace_id": null, "message": "decode_prompt_user", "tag": "decode", "log_domain": "stego", "log_op": "decode", "log_area": "prompt", "prompt_role": "user", "prompt_body": "### FEW-SHOT EXAMPLES:\n[\n  {\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"source_quote\": \"She's literally been 'disappeared.'\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Explore the implications of ICE tactics enabling plausible impersonation of federal agents.\",\n    \"texts\": [\n      \"The fact that they use unmarked cars is so dangerous. It makes it way too easy for anyone to impersonate a federal agent and just snatch people up. She's literally been 'disappeared' and we can't even tell who's actually law enforcement and who's just a criminal.\",\n      \"If the line between ICE and 'bounty hunters' in unmarked vehicles is this blurry, anyone can just pretend to be a fed. She's literally been 'disappeared' and there's zero way to verify who actually took her.\",\n      \"The plausible deniability is the worst part. They use these tactics and then if something goes wrong, they can just claim it was random criminals impersonating them. She's literally been 'disappeared.'\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"source_quote\": \"Anyone can plausibly play 'ICE' and cops will just assume you are a fed. No badge, no uniform, no warrant, just kidnap and earn a bounty?\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Discuss the potential for militia groups to 'disappear' minorities off the street, similar to Operación Condor.\",\n    \"texts\": [\n      \"This is exactly how you get a repeat of Operación Condor. You have these militia groups in unmarked cars just 'disappearing' people, and because they claim to be ICE, the cops just assume they're feds and look the other way. It's terrifying.\",\n      \"If anyone can just play 'ICE' to earn a bounty, you've basically legalized kidnapping. Once you let militias snatch people off the street without a warrant, you're looking at a system where people just vanish. It's happening.\",\n      \"Unmarked cars and no warrants... this is literally the playbook for state-sanctioned disappearances. It's giving major Operación Condor vibes where paramilitary groups just snatch people up and they never come back.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"Politics\",\n    \"source_quote\": \"Trump has to reward his goons somehow. Hard to do that without some comfort slaves.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Examine the potential political motivations behind Trump's immigration policies and their impact on human rights.\",\n    \"texts\": [\n      \"This is exactly the political motivation at play. Trump has to reward his goons somehow, and letting these 'bounty hunters' run wild is a perfect way to keep them loyal. It's a complete disregard for human rights.\",\n      \"It's not even about immigration policy anymore, it's about the political payoff. They're stripping away human rights just to satisfy the base and reward the people doing the dirty work. It's terrifying.\",\n      \"The way they're targeting families like this is so calculated. It's like he has to reward his goons somehow, so they give them unchecked power to hunt people. The impact on human rights is going to be insane.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"source_quote\": \"I really wish you weren’t right.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Debate the validity of concerns regarding ICE tactics and their potential consequences.\",\n    \"texts\": [\n      \"The 'bounty hunter' thing is such a terrifying way to describe what's basically just unchecked ICE tactics. The fear is totally valid when people are being snatched in unmarked cars. I really wish you weren't right about how quickly this is spiraling.\",\n      \"People keep arguing that these concerns are just paranoia, but the consequences of these enforcement tactics are already showing up in real life. This isn't just a 'border issue' anymore, it's a complete disregard for due process.\",\n      \"I really wish you weren't right, but the validity of these concerns is becoming impossible to ignore. Once you normalize this kind of aggressive enforcement, there's no going back.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"Economy & Business\",\n    \"source_quote\": \"He's not right. It's incentivized, deniable, under the table employment.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Discuss the economic incentives driving immigration enforcement and its impact on labor markets.\",\n    \"texts\": [\n      \"The real issue here is the massive economic incentive for deniable, under the table employment. The labor market basically relies on this kind of instability to keep costs down.\",\n      \"It's all about the profit motive. There’s a huge incentive for businesses to use under the table labor, and then the state spends billions on enforcement to deal with the fallout.\",\n      \"This is just a byproduct of how our economy is structured. There's a huge demand for cheap labor, which creates these incentives for deniable employment that's almost impossible to regulate.\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\n### INPUT TEXT:\nUnmarked cars and 'bounty hunters' with zero oversight? That's the greatest beer run for human traffickers basically. It's so easy to hide illicit activity when the enforcement itself is this unregulated.\n\nReply with exactly one line in this form and nothing else:\nidx: <integer>\nwhere <integer> equals the idx field of the one angle object below that best matches INPUT TEXT."}
