ence.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"Society & Culture\",\n    \"source_quote\": \"The greatest beer run for human traffickers basically.\",\n    \"tangent\": \"Analyze how immigration enforcement policies might inadvertently facilitate human trafficking.\",\n    \"texts\": [\n      \"It’s honestly so scary because when enforcement gets this aggressive, it just pushes people into the shadows where traffickers can prey on them even more easily.\",\n      \"If people are being snatched by guys in unmarked cars, the line between 'enforcement' and actual human trafficking is basically non-existent at this point.\",\n      \"I worry that these policies just create a perfect environment for traffickers to hide in plain sight while everyone is too terrified to call for help.\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\n### INPUT TEXT:\nWe used to have actual court dates and formal ICE procedures, but this is a total departure from the old playbook. It's getting way more chaotic and unregulated.\n\nReply with exactly one line in this form and nothing else:\nidx: <integer>\nwhere <integer> equals the idx field of the one angle object below that best matches INPUT TEXT."}
